WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.890
Why is the periodic table shaped so oddly?

00:00:04.890 --> 00:00:08.730
Elements are lined up by their number of protons.

00:00:08.730 --> 00:00:12.210
Each row starts a new layer of electrons.

00:00:12.210 --> 00:00:15.740
Columns hold elements that behave alike.

00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:21.013
The shape comes from the pattern.
